<title>USA: GOLF-SCORES AT PEBBLE BEACH AFTER FINAL ROUND.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SCORES AT PEBBLE BEACH AFTER FINAL ROUND.</headline>
<dateline>PEBBLE BEACH, California 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores</p>
<p>after the final round of the $1.9 million AT&amp;T Pebble Beach</p>
<p>National Pro-Am golf tournament on Sunday (players U.S. unless</p>
<p>noted):</p>
<p>268 Mark O'Meara 67 67 67 67</p>
<p>269 Tiger Woods 70 72 63 64, David Duval 65 71 62 71</p>
<p>273 Jim Furyk 67 65 69 72</p>
<p>274 Craig Stadler 70 69 66 69, Jesper Parnevik (Sweden) 65 70</p>
<p>67 72</p>
<p>275 Billy Andrade 66 75 66 68, Paul Azinger 69 70 67 69</p>
<p>276 Glen Day 70 69 67 70, Mike Brisky 69 68 68 71</p>
<p>277 Paul Stankowski 67 67 74 69, Mark Wiebe 69 68 71 69, Ted</p>
<p>Tryba 68 67 72 70, Brian Henninger 66 69 71 71</p>
<p>278 Doug Martin 70 70 69 69, Brad Faxon 70 69 69 70, Tom</p>
<p>Watson 68 71 68 71, Steve Elkington (Australia) 70 66 69 73,</p>
<p>Vijay Singh (Fiji) 67 68 71 72</p>
